---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { ORG } from "../lib/content";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice" description="How Springrise Foundation collects, uses and protects your information.">
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="h1 reveal" style="margin-top:1rem;">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="margin-top:1rem;">Last updated September 27, 2026.</p>

      <div class="prose reveal" style="margin-top:2.5rem; --d:.08s;">
        <p>Springrise Foundation ("Springrise," "we," "us") respects your privacy. This notice explains what information we collect through springrise.org, why we collect it, and the choices you have.</p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Scholarship application details and the documents you upload (resume, transcript, enrollment verification, personal statement, tuition statement, and disability documentation if provided).</li>
          <li>Messages you send us through a contact, donation or volunteer form — name, email, phone and whatever you write.</li>
          <li>Email addresses submitted to receive season alerts or other updates.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>We use this information to evaluate scholarship applications, respond to your questions, process gifts and matching-gift requests, coordinate volunteers and mentors, and send the updates you've asked for. We don't use it for advertising.</p>

        <h2>Who can see it</h2>
        <p>Application materials are visible only to authorized foundation staff and members of the Board of Directors involved in scholarship review. We don't share your information with outside parties except where needed to operate the foundation (for example, sending a scholarship payment to your school) or where the law requires it.</p>

        <h2>Where it's stored</h2>
        <p>Our site and the information submitted through it are hosted on Cloudflare infrastructure and encrypted in transit.</p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>We retain information for as long as needed to administer scholarships, respond to your inquiry, and meet our legal and recordkeeping obligations.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>To access, correct or delete your information, or to unsubscribe from email updates, email us at <a href={`mailto:${ORG.emails.info}`}>{ORG.emails.info}</a>.</p>

        <h2>We never sell your data</h2>
        <p>Springrise does not sell or rent your personal information to anyone.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our public site does not use advertising or tracking cookies. We use a single strictly-necessary cookie to keep authorized staff signed in to the internal application-review workspace.</p>

        <h2>Applicants under 18</h2>
        <p>If you're applying for a scholarship and are under 18, please apply with a parent or guardian's awareness.</p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>Questions about this notice can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${ORG.emails.info}`}>{ORG.emails.info}</a> or mailed to {ORG.legalName}, {ORG.address.line1}, {ORG.address.city}, {ORG.address.region} {ORG.address.postal}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
